  "text": "proprium.dominica-xvii-post-pentecosten-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “17th Sunday after Pentecost” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "By Your sanctifications, almighty God, may our vices be cured and eternal remedies come forth for us. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Your Son, who lives and reigns with You in the unity of the Holy Spirit, God, forever and ever." },
    "s02": { "translation": "Amen." }
  },
